# Google Play Publishing Files

## Files generated for publishing
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
release/
*.aab
*.apk

# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES
# 1. NEVER commit keystore files (.jks, .keystore) to version control
# 2. NEVER commit key.properties with real passwords
# 3. Keep your keystore file in a secure backup location
# 4. If you lose your keystore, you CANNOT update your app on Play Store
